{"id":51710,"date":"2026-06-19T05:49:57","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T04:49:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/axtrail-series-4-fajao\/"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:27:46","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:27:46","slug":"axtrail-series-4-fajao","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/axtrail-series-4-fajao\/","title":{"rendered":"AXtrail Series #4 Faj\u00e3o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">AXtrail Series #4 Faj\u00e3o 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>AXtrail Series #4 Faj\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na m\u00edtica <strong>Aldeia do Xisto de Faj\u00e3o<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Pampilhosa da Serra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Organizado pelo pioneiro <strong>Clube de Praticantes Mondego Ultra Trail<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Pampilhosa da Serra<\/strong> e da rede <strong>Aldeias do Xisto<\/strong>, o evento encerra o consagrado circuito AXtrail com a sua grande final.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com o secretariado a abrir \u00e0s 07:00, a prova principal <strong>AXtrail Series #4 de 24 km (+1.500m D+)<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> num tra\u00e7ado linear que inclui transporte de autocarro para a partida e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o top 5 geral. Seguem-se o <strong>AXtrail Xperience de 11 km (+800m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:00 e o <strong>Caminho do Xisto de 8 km<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:35, percorrendo as soberbas arribas rochosas, passadi\u00e7os e florestas da Serra do A\u00e7or.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-directi